---
---
<section id="about" class="container">
  <p class="section-label">About</p>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <p class="bio">
      I build the systems that sit behind authentication, payments, and critical data flows —
      the kind of code that can't go down. My work spans distributed backend services,
      cloud infrastructure on AWS, and developer tooling for teams shipping fast.
    </p>
    <ul class="highlights">
      <li>
        <span class="hi-num">6+</span>
        <span class="hi-label">Years of experience</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="hi-num">3</span>
        <span class="hi-label">Companies in prod</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="hi-num">∞</span>
        <span class="hi-label">On-call incidents survived</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section { background: var(--bg); }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bio {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .highlights {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .highlights li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .hi-num {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .hi-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .highlights { flex-direction: row; gap: 2rem; }
    .highlights li { align-items: flex-start; }
    .hi-label { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
